  1012	a new driver identifier or an explicit versioned execution-policy revision.
  1013	Because `execution_policy` is inside the hashed input, an entry produced under a
  1014	different execution contract, or under a pre-revision input that carried no
  1015	execution policy at all, MUST miss and MUST NOT alias a portable entry. Host
  1016	capability evidence is not an input: a manager MUST NOT add it to, or infer it
  1017	from, the cache key.
